<td align="center" class="whiteBkgnd">
<table border="0" class="dk-blueBkgnd" cellpadding="1" cellspacing="1" hspace="0" width="300" summary="" style="border-collapse: collapse">
<tr>
<td class="whiteBkgnd" valign="top" align="center" height="18">
<a href="/pls/oshaweb/owaredirect.html?p_url=http://www.asse.org/newsroom/naosh09/" title="NAOSH 2009" name="Privacy Policy Noted - LD 11/05/08">
<img border="0" src="/dcsp/alliances/asse/naosh_2009.jpg" width="300" height="52" alt="NAOSH 2009" title="NAOSH 2009"></a><br>
<br>

<img border="0" src="apca_signing.jpg" alt="(L to R) OSHA's then-Assistant Secretary Edwin G. Foulke, Jr. and J.D. Lormand - Executive Director, APCA sign a national Alliance on January 25, 2007." title="(L to R) OSHA's then-Assistant Secretary Edwin G. Foulke, Jr. and J.D. Lormand - Executive Director, APCA sign a national Alliance on January 25, 2007." vspace="1" hspace="1" width="300" height="202"><br>
<span class="blackSixCaption">(L to R) OSHA's then-Assistant Secretary Edwin G. 
Foulke, Jr. and J.D. Lormand - Executive Director, APCA sign a national Alliance 
on January 25, 2007.<br>
&nbsp;</span>
</td>
</tr>
